# AI-AGENT NOTICE: Scheduled-only interface. Use only when
# control_modes.<mode>.inference.scheduler.enable=true. Do not use on the legacy inference path.
# Goal: Open a product inference session or a pipeline-local binding.
# session_id is a caller-generated UUID4. Routing belongs exclusively to each
# ScheduledDispatchInfer request; Open never selects a model or fallback chain.
string<=36 session_id
builtin_interfaces/Time deadline
---
# Result. Global logical Open leaves pipeline identity fields empty. A
# pipeline-scoped Open fills them for Global's private binding validation.
bool success
string<=36 session_id
string<=63 actual_pipeline_id
uint64 session_generation
string<=64 deployment_fingerprint
string<=64 runtime_policy_fingerprint
builtin_interfaces/Time lease_expires_at
ibrobot_msgs/InferenceOutcome outcome
ibrobot_msgs/ScheduledInferenceError error
---
# Feedback (not used for correctness)
string<=128 status
